    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i dont know if it's temporary. it feels more like a realization. like i spent my whole life pretending there was something meaningful under the surface, but i've finally reached the bottom and there's just nothing. it's not a phase, it's just the truth of who i am now. there's no spark to rediscover if the fire is actually dead.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
